  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">[학생동료평가 프로그램]에 이어</span></b><br><b><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/371\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/371</span></a></b></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/371\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=evuJ&amp;datanum=371\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/371\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/371\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">작년에 만들었던</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">학생들이 각자 한개 문항을 출제하고</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그 문항들을 친구들이 풀어보는 웹앱<b>(학생 동료 출제 프로그램)</b></span><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">즉, 반에 26명이 있으면,</span></span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">각자 문항 한개를 출제 하면, 친구들의 문항 25개의 문항을 풀 수 있게 하는 웹앱</span></b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">을</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">배포판으로 만들었습니다.<br><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/341\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/341</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"모든 이야기의 시작 - Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"모든 이야기의 시작, Daum 카페\" data-og-host=\"m.cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/341\" data-og-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/_cafeTop\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cSSd1W/dJMb8TB8Jwn/z1ZiakQvqrwCbnnNAZfQ90/kakaolink40_original.png?width=1200&amp;height=628\"><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/341\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/341\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cSSd1W/dJMb8TB8Jwn/z1ZiakQvqrwCbnnNAZfQ90/kakaolink40_original.png?width=1200&amp;height=628\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">모든 이야기의 시작 - Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\">모든 이야기의 시작, Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">위 링크 글과 관련^^<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단, 제미나이 API키를 넣어야 합니다</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">제미나이(AI)가 문항을 출제할때 문항에 오류가 있는지 없는지</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">확인을 해주는 기능이 들어 있습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MXVAyhg7ZJxaPKhvRvQxmpLISEXXO32_FV_aWwl-7f8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MXVAyhg7ZJxaPKhvRvQxmpLISEXXO32_FV_aWwl-7f8/edit?usp=sharing</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"[배포판]문항 만들어 공유하기(학생답채점에서는 AI피드백 없음)\" data-og-description=\"이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요.\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MXVAyhg7ZJxaPKhvRvQxmpLISEXXO32_FV_aWwl-7f8/edit?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MXVAyhg7ZJxaPKhvRvQxmpLISEXXO32_FV_aWwl-7f8/edit?usp=sharing&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/wmEKJ/dJMb9c9w4l4/rSN3kV58qbqXzQu5whHxY0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MXVAyhg7ZJxaPKhvRvQxmpLISEXXO32_FV_aWwl-7f8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MXVAyhg7ZJxaPKhvRvQxmpLISEXXO32_FV_aWwl-7f8/edit?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/wmEKJ/dJMb9c9w4l4/rSN3kV58qbqXzQu5whHxY0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">[배포판]문항 만들어 공유하기(학생답채점에서는 AI피드백 없음)</p><p class=\"og-desc\">이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요.</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">설치 방법</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1. 위 링크를 클릭합니다</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c55999adf23e3b8f1be0e5d84cbea887fe48f6ab\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c55999adf23e3b8f1be0e5d84cbea887fe48f6ab\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"680\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2. 메뉴 [파일] 클릭 - [사본 만들기] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/df58e5696e16d5b658c1dc53ce09d06cd3d1cb8f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/df58e5696e16d5b658c1dc53ce09d06cd3d1cb8f\" data-origin-width=\"510\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3. 사본 만들기 팝업창에서 [사본 만들기] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0613cc9e04bea7ed4e6ba543f8116648a0a14ae1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0613cc9e04bea7ed4e6ba543f8116648a0a14ae1\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"356\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4. </span><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">사본이 만들어진</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> 스프레드시트에서 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">상단 메뉴 [확장 프로그램] 클릭 - [Apps Scripts] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f431be9cc2a475ffae1470214243ee75363cacf\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f431be9cc2a475ffae1470214243ee75363cacf\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"421\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5. 왼쪽 메뉴에서 [프로젝트 설정] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8ac4a1de2b1420dfeffc570f5e74860395e1def\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8ac4a1de2b1420dfeffc570f5e74860395e1def\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"759\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">6. 제일 아래쪽에 [스크립트 속성 추가] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/207df2e13d38037930167465f579457cc99ebd66\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/207df2e13d38037930167465f579457cc99ebd66\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"321\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">속성에는 </span></b><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">=&gt; GEMINI_API_KEY 입력</span></b></span><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">값은 =&gt; 개인적으로 발급 받은 제미나이(GEMINI) 키값 입력</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">개인적으로 발급 받은 제미나이(GEMINI) 키값 발급 받기</span></b></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" data-ke-list-type=\"disc\"><li>&#160;</li><li>&#160;</li></ul><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4df7620765462d90ba4a2765590ce9d28553fd0a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4df7620765462d90ba4a2765590ce9d28553fd0a\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"533\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/150883726c6b8be28025282016cf744e1da443de\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/150883726c6b8be28025282016cf744e1da443de\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"375\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">발급 받은 키 값은 위 빨간색 클릭하면 보입니다</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">복사하여서 위에 키 값 입력하시면 됩니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다시 돌아와서</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f894b2c2638e9a1bd1e4f3c625f281f40f82f0d8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f894b2c2638e9a1bd1e4f3c625f281f40f82f0d8\" data-origin-width=\"574\" data-origin-height=\"394\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">7. [스크립트 속성 저장] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aeaba8dac653c60f037813b7443afd24c0de0506\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aeaba8dac653c60f037813b7443afd24c0de0506\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"169\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">8. 오른쪽 상단 [배포] 클릭 - [새 배포] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f6fd622b625caae7308ee28f2c9318f7a7403ae\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f6fd622b625caae7308ee28f2c9318f7a7403ae\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"543\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/514daad1a3e91d7e6d5b7820a4147a547f84a863\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/514daad1a3e91d7e6d5b7820a4147a547f84a863\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"536\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">9. 그리고 위 그림대로(빨간색 화살표 순대로 진행)</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">중간에 엑세스 승인이 뜨면 위 그림대로<span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">(체크박스 모두 체크 해야 함)</span></span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">(빨간색 화살표 순대로 진행)</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그리고</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ef5618628cea02da783bf9e910556d51e756a66d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ef5618628cea02da783bf9e910556d51e756a66d\" data-origin-width=\"842\" data-origin-height=\"739\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">사본 만든 스프레드 시트에</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아래 시트가 학급반이며</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">내용에 학생 명단을 넣으면</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아이들이 로그인을 할 수 있습니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\">아이들에게 배포할 링크는</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53ac51ab519d5b1939f4f0717dd3029732eded36\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53ac51ab519d5b1939f4f0717dd3029732eded36\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"356\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">사본 만든 스프레드시트에서</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">[확장 프로그램] - [App Scrits] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f7073023a3e54e8aa6572678ec2ff59f932bb8e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f7073023a3e54e8aa6572678ec2ff59f932bb8e\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"177\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이번에는 [배포] -[배포 관리] 클릭</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5eaaf6125392d9607bdeed9c0e71d1d805f6af4d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5eaaf6125392d9607bdeed9c0e71d1d805f6af4d\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"747\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">웹앱 URL 주소를 학생들에게 배포하면 됩니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}